From f4be37f79fdb40352929d1d7e39c67dc6f157179 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DrakeRamorayJr <179530612+DrakeRamorayJr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:12:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bare: show the keyboard for tab search and focus the omnibox
 from the pill

Opening tab search from the sheet now clears the IME suppression flag and
defers showing the keyboard until the sheet window has focus, so the soft
keyboard reliably appears and results stay above it. Tapping the origin
pill closes the sheet and defers focusing the omnibox until the activity
window regains focus, so the address bar is focused with the keyboard up.

Back still hides the keyboard first, then clears the search and returns the sheet
to its stop, then closes it.
